{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52392","headline":"回波乐 三十五 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 三十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纵使千乘君，终齐一个死。\n纵令万品食，终同一种屎。\n释迦穷八字，老君守一理。\n若欲离死生，当须急思此。\n夜梦与昼游，本不相知尔。\n梦恶便生懊，梦好觉便喜。\n你信斋戒身，本自不识你。\n欲验死更生，方斯以类比。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}